{1}{Ahhh...who calls upon me?  Tireless are the souls of the dead, but how it seems to wear upon me to cross that river.  Winston, I see...and another...yes, I suppose I knew this day would come.  Welcome, traveller...}{Ahhh...who calls upon me?  Tireless are the souls of the dead, but how it seems to wear upon me to cross that river.  Winston, I see...and another...yes, I suppose I knew this day would come.  Welcome, traveller...}{}{}{}{  gf2070 1}
