{85}{There were thefts, beatings and threats. Mysterious letters in the night, warning the "little gnomes" to keep to their place. The gnomes tried human bodyguards, to no avail. Any human that would be a bodyguard to a gnome at that time was, by definition, an untrustworthy, shiftless sort. Orcs were out of the question because of their racial hatred for gnomes.}{There were thefts, beatings and threats. Mysterious letters in the night, warning the "little gnomes" to keep to their place. The gnomes tried human bodyguards, to no avail. Any human that would be a bodyguard to a gnome at that time was, by definition, an untrustworthy, shiftless sort. Orcs were out of the question because of their racial hatred for gnomes.}{}{}{}{}
